<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.32 vs   1.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.68 vs   2.05</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.73 vs   0.02 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   22.88 vs  15.60</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.03 vs   5.42</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.06 vs   7.56</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.54 vs   4.29</p>
<p> Sales		  173.36 vs 125.83</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat-processing company is</p>
<p>Sokolowskie Zaklady Miesne SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
